    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/zaalreservatie>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Detailed document describing the condition of a property at a given time."@en;
