    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/zaalreservatie>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Activity in which a certain service, space, or object is reserved in advance for future use."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/cultuur-en-jeugd/infrastructuur#Reservatie>;
