    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The condition(s) that is (are) necessary to cancel a particular reservation."@en;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "In the context of room reservation, it is a cancellation of a room according to various conditions (such as time)."@en;
