<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/zaalreservatie#buffer> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/zaalreservatie>;
