    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Period that creates time or space for a process or action."@en;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "In connection with room reservation, a \"buffer\" is used to prevent two events or meetings from being scheduled immediately after each other in the same room. It is a fixed time span that cannot be reserved after a room reservation."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/KandidaatStandaard>.
